CMEnt example data attribution
==============================

The bundled example files are provided for package examples, vignettes, and
tests:

  o example_pheno.rds
  o example_outputChr5And11.rds
  o example_outputChr5And11.meta.rds
  o example_outputChr5And11.dmrs.tsv.gz

These files are derived from DMRsegaldata, archived at Zenodo DOI
10.5281/zenodo.17475298. The Zenodo record lists Vasileios Lemonidis as creator
and the data license as CC-BY-4.0.

The supportedOrganisms.csv file is package-maintained metadata describing
organism and genome-build support used by CMEnt.
